# {{BINARY_NAME}} {{VERSION}} ({{PLATFORM}})

A homeCore command-line tool. One statically linked musl binary with no
glibc, OpenSSL or other system dependencies. It needs no core on this
machine: it talks to one over the network.

## Install

    tar -xzf {{BINARY_NAME}}-{{VERSION}}-{{PLATFORM}}.tar.gz
    sudo install -m 0755 {{BINARY_NAME}}/bin/{{BINARY_NAME}} /usr/local/bin/

## Use

    {{BINARY_NAME}} --help

The documentation is at https://homecore.io/docs/tools/{{BINARY_NAME}}.
